      "description": "Sole action creating a provisional physical copy; opening entry creates nothing.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-sample\"><button class=\"ds-button ds-primary\">Save copy</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-sample{font-family:var(--font,system-ui);font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink,#302B28)}.ds-button{font:inherit;min-height:44px;border:1px solid var(--rule,#C6C9C3);border-radius:var(--radius,6px);background:var(--paper,#FFFFFF);color:var(--ink,#302B28);padding:var(--control-pad,10px) 16px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}.ds-button:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--soft,#E8EEE9);border-color:var(--accent,#823B3D)}.ds-button:active:not(:disabled){background:var(--soft,#E8EEE9)}.ds-button:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:default}.ds-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#823B3D);outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.ds-button{transition:background-color .15s ease-out,border-color .15s ease-out}}.ds-primary{background:var(--accent,#823B3D);color:var(--accent-text,#FFFFFF);border-color:var(--accent,#823B3D);padding:var(--control-pad,10px) 24px}.ds-primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--hover,#823B3D);color:var(--accent-text,#FFFFFF);text-decoration:underline}",
